WEBVTT

00:11:57.915 --> 00:12:00.748
The other path, stepping out of grief,

00:12:00.772 --> 00:12:03.136
will not change or undo anything.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.442
It will be hard.

00:12:05.466 --> 00:12:07.187
It will always be hard,

00:12:07.211 --> 00:12:11.766
with high mountains
and deep, dark valleys.

00:12:12.512 --> 00:12:16.134
But this path looks forward
and moves forward.

00:12:16.627 --> 00:12:18.715
When I learned to dance with fire,

00:12:18.739 --> 00:12:22.119
I learned to reconcile
the traumatic part of my life

00:12:22.143 --> 00:12:25.682
with the totality of my life
as it was still unfolding.

00:12:26.738 --> 00:12:28.929
Fire became more than just trauma

00:12:28.953 --> 00:12:30.896
but beauty and art as well,